  "text_md": "<!-- image -->\n\n[Full name]\n\n[Function]\n\n[Company name]\n\n[Full official address]\n\nE-mail: [complete]\n\nBy derogation from this Article; different contact details for the contracting authority or the contractor may be provided in specific contracts.\n\n## 1.9. PROCESSING OF PERSONAL DATA\n\n## 1.9.1 Processing of personal data by the contracting authority\n\nFor the purpose of Article II.9.1,\n\n- a) the data controller is the Head of Resource and Service Centre at the European Agency for Safety and Health at Work;\n- b) the privacy statement is available at https:llosha.europa eulenlabout-eu-oshalprocurement.\n\n## 1.9.2 Processing of personal data by the contractor\n\nFor the purpose of Article II.9.2,\n\n- a) the subject matter and purpose of the processing of personal data by the contractor are [provide a short and concise description of the subject matter and purpose];\n2. the personal data shall only be processed within the territory of the European Union and the European Economic Area and will not leave that territory;\n- b) the localisation of and access to the personal data processed by the contractor shall comply with the following?:\n4. the data shall only be held in data centres located with the territory of the European Union and the European Economic Area;\n5. iv any   transfer of personal data under  the FWC to third  countries or  international with the requirements laid down in Chapter V of Regulation (EU)2018/17253 .\n6. the contractor may not change the location of data processing without the written authorisation of the contracting authority; prior\n\nThis clause must be adapted with care on the basis of a risk assessment related to the processing of personal data for the relevant contract.\n\nRegulation (EU) 2018/1725 of 23 October 2018 on the protection of natural persons with regard to the processing of personal data by the Union institutions, bodies; offices and agencies and on the free movement of such data; and repealing Regulation (EC) No 45/2001 and Decision No 1247/2002/EC, OJ L 295/39,\n\n<!-- image -->",
